\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ German Fin Min Schaeuble: China Knows It Needs To Move On Yuan Rate\b0\par\par\uc2 305 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2011\par 12:51\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2011, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 30 Mar 2011 06:54 EDT *DJ  Schaeuble: China Knows That Moving On Yuan Rate Is In Its Own Interest\par \par \uc2 30 Mar 2011 06:56 EDT *DJ  Schaeuble: Greater \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Balance Only If Moving Towards Convertibility\par \par \uc2 30 Mar 2011 06:57 EDT *DJ  Schaeuble: But Exchange Rate Advances Can't Be Reached In One Year\par \par \uc2 30 Mar 2011 06:58 EDT *DJ  Schaeuble: \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan Forex Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Has Shown That Cooperation Effective\par \par \uc2 30 Mar 2011 07:15 EDT DJ  German Finance Minister: China Knows It Needs To Move On Yuan Rate\par \par \uc2 BEIJING (Dow Jones)--Chinese leaders know they need to move on the yuan's exchange rate "in their own interests," German Finance Minister Wolfgang Schaeuble said Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Cooperation in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  issues isn't a one-way street, and both sides need to move toward each other, Schaeuble said at a press briefing after meeting Chinese Finance Minister Xie Xuren and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Gov. Zhou Xiaochuan.\par \par \uc2 Schaeuble will take part in a G-20 seminar on reshaping the global monetary system Thursday in Nanjing, China.\par \par \uc2 "We can reach a stronger balance in \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  only through moving into the direction of free convertibility," Schaeuble said, adding that there is a willingness among all parties to move toward each other.\par \par \uc2 "Obviously, that (convertibility) can't be reached from one year to the other," he said.\par \par \uc2 Schaeuble said he also discussed the situation in Japan with his Chinese partners, but didn't talk about any concrete aid measures.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Group of Seven nations has shown that "cooperation has been very efficient," he said.\par \par \uc2 -By Bernd Radowitz, Dow Jones Newswires; +49-30-2888-4126; bernd.radowitz@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 March 30, 2011 07:15 ET (11:15 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020110330e73u002xn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
